    <item>
      <title>Muscle matters as we age</title>
      <link>https://www.silverithm.com/en/post/muscle-matters-as-we-age</link>
      <description>Ageing brings wisdom, but also changes we don’t always notice—until everyday tasks feel harder. One of the most overlooked is sarcopenia: the gradual loss of muscle mass and strength. For many, it’s already underway before we realise it. Sarcopenia often creeps in quietly. Yet it isn’t an inevitable decline—it’s a challenge that can be managed with awareness, consistent exercise, and smart nutrition.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.silverithm.com/en/post/muscle-matters-as-we-age</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5d3f7_00ac12af404d4701bec996cb0ffcc3fc~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_800,h_534,al_c,q_85/c5d3f7_00ac12af404d4701bec996cb0ffcc3fc~mv2.webp" length="0" type="image/webp"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Jan 2026 00:26:45 +0000</pubDate>
